OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged with raping woman
OL,4,Ain Arbroath
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt accused of raping a woman in
OL,8,FArbroath.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the incident on
OL,11,FArbirlot Road, near Monymusk Road, at
OL,12,Fabout 06:10 on Monday.
OL,14,FAshton Douglas, from Arbroath, made no
OL,15,Fplea during an appearance in private at
OL,16,FForfar Sheriff Court.
OL,18,FThe case was continued for further
OL,19,Fexamination and he was released on
OL,20,Fbail.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
